{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d89edd63980e610136ec04845a4c63f156bfbe968415b860c87a3e8da3850103", "ja": "（杏奈の要望でオフの日に遊ぶことになった。\nゲームで思いきり遊んで、いい息抜きになったな……）", "zh": "（应杏奈的请求，我们约好在休息日一起玩。尽情玩了游戏，真是好好放松了一下……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "8ac70922991c97eec1e491b4223e53e57db41a5b0167dc0e606c6e6704a8a613", "ja": "{$P$}さん……少し、疲れた……？\nいっぱいゲーム、したし……次は休憩に、する……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……有点累了……？  \n玩了好多游戏……接下来，要休息一下吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1002_p", "source_sha256": "704f79322f3316257b10e9717498f6d8ac85d49be743b7c718a8c5cbd0979a6e", "ja": "ああ、そうしてもらえると助かるよ。\nでも夕方だから、あまり長居は出来ないけど。", "zh": "啊，那就麻烦你了。\n不过现在已经是傍晚了，不能待太久。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "1845e4c48b1341f0e8c19692b344d4445567ab809512cffcca07d856843b430d", "ja": "もう……？　なんだか、あっという間……。\n楽しいと……いつも、そう……。", "zh": "已经……？总觉得、一眨眼就……\n开心的时候……总是、这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "488cfc574d9b5f7cba48f7fa7f18a8b74ef44525a708799695077c43549a4e4e", "ja": "ゲーム、楽しくて……気づいたら、すごい時間が\n過ぎてて……。でも今日は、もっと短いかも……。", "zh": "游戏太开心了……回过神来，已经过去好长时间了……不过今天可能会更短……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1005_p", "source_sha256": "02f7e32c804efaae98d5fbe02e924c2180c0e27ba479ef570ee28b6ed60e2ba0", "ja": "それだけ、杏奈も楽しかったってことだな。\nあとぬいぐるみも、ありがとう！　大切にするよ。", "zh": "也就是说，杏奈也玩得很开心啊。\n还有，谢谢你送的毛绒玩偶！我会好好珍惜的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "f26457c3741da767b005d4b0977a3e25bc9b0ccfbfa654c0d84407ecd49ff6fc", "ja": "うん……♪　杏奈のも、取れたら……\nお揃い、だったのにね……。残念……。", "zh": "嗯……♪　要是杏奈的那个也能抓到……\n就能凑成一对了呢……真可惜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "ca35f5c61c1b18085d07e607efda9adc3861f49022cbb38b73b3f0dfe242e0ac", "ja": "大きいぬいぐるみ、ふたつあると……\nいっぱい遊ぶのに……かさばっちゃう、から……。", "zh": "要是拿了两个大玩偶……\n想痛快玩的话……就会很占地方……所以……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3e12c02dd5c70abd96d66db48fe74049b02f025a74f8a004d157f28e4e46c536", "ja": "気遣ってくれたんだな、ありがとう……。\nじゃあ、杏奈の分は今度取りに来ようか。", "zh": "你是在替我着想啊，谢谢你……\n那杏奈的那份，下次再来取吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "00ffba2e2929b22206a76b47794e87d300f0cf175016699489bd7a639a848948", "ja": "ほんと……？　{$P$}さんと、\n一緒の、ぬいぐるみ……えへへ……♪", "zh": "真的……？和{$P$}先生一起的、毛绒玩偶……嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "5766c43e7eefcf4087397fa08084a5cbefbbf90a82418f6e746e74666c4bf2af", "ja": "……でも、今度って……。\n{$P$}さん……忙しい、でしょ……？", "zh": "……可是，下次……。\n{$P$}先生……很忙，对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1011_p", "source_sha256": "bf28586651f220265a7cfa3e02abc39f2b71e81b5509aeeabeeb4cccb5512be8", "ja": "うっ……！\n予定は……ごめん。今はまだ、なんとも……。", "zh": "唔……！\n日程的话……抱歉。现在还不好说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "796d12a702d322d3f2db4278b00b9f09aba90b2a7a659138c0fedd16cc08dbd0", "ja": "そう、だよね……。杏奈、平気だよ……。\nだけど……今日は……まだ、一緒にいたい、です……。", "zh": "嗯，说得对……杏奈没事的……  \n但是……今天……我还想和你待在一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "1bfb48b92a41121937d3e5c2a15ee9989d4e8276bd77f47415edca26419909fb", "ja": "行きたいところ、とか……\nまだたくさん、あるから……。", "zh": "想去的地方……\n还有好多……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1014_p", "source_sha256": "45c17d8eaad2fa98e02ae1c14fea7190954a5d56b3b9385aa13e5645ea61918d", "ja": "よし、わかった！\n暗くなるまで、杏奈の行きたいところ全部行こう！", "zh": "好，我知道了！\n在天黑之前，把杏奈想去的地方都去个遍吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "6f935b6b3a24656cb9e75092562c85bd6f1c752a0f59faa3738d90181788cdba", "ja": "……。\nやっぱり、暗くなったら、ダメ……？", "zh": "……。\n天黑了的话，果然……不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ab5f3fcf3361a3dfc27aa287d6c15bb618d67565d1577c2b2e74da4a66b2c51e", "ja": "そうだな。暗くなると危険なこともあるしな。\nそれに遅くなると、ご家族も心配すると思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。天黑了确实可能会有危险。\n而且回去晚了，你的家人也会担心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "9701bc378924c412e92abe92cfdc6b22842f5fbb2216fce6f950b94abf00f92b", "ja": "そっか……。杏奈……次、遊ぶ日が……\n待ちきれなくて……。ずっと、考えちゃいそう……。", "zh": "这样啊……杏奈……等不及下次一起玩的日子……可能会一直想着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1018_p", "source_sha256": "a02a3c9aa7c2b546d938781951df320f7275ff399a8da887e42dd9a38c3627c6", "ja": "うーん……じゃあ早く帰る代わりに、\n次の遊ぶ予定は早くするっていうのはどうだ？", "zh": "嗯……那这样怎么样？与其早点回去，不如把下次一起玩的时间提前。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c94e968dba34eed00f9561d7f9d2c268f9f2416dbd702b54e5d789c2780edc80", "ja": "まあ、実際に調整してみないとわからないけど……。\n杏奈のために、できるだけ早い日にちを探すよ。", "zh": "不过，实际协调之后才能知道……我会为了杏奈，尽量找个早点的日子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "3f96ff866a8f47f295f364e9bf1cc29b407994d3e6760be5437f480305e996c0", "ja": "いいの……？　それなら……うん……。\nわがまま、聞いてくれて……ありがとう、です……。", "zh": "真的可以吗……？既然这样……嗯……\n谢谢你……听我任性……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1021_p", "source_sha256": "de974674bb0532dc174400d59d3916b7673ae267ff093e53b26aa3d8b0fa4338", "ja": "ああ。杏奈が、わがままを言ってくれるのは\n嬉しいからな。もっとわがままでもいいくらいだ。", "zh": "啊。因为杏奈愿意对我任性，我很高兴。再任性一点也没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "8bc0cec9cad36091d6e2e244e86b4ad0f8250454cfb9f97e1db59b3d1a625cb9", "ja": "もっと、わがまま……？　わかった……。\nんと……今は、思いつかないけど……頑張って、みる。", "zh": "还要……更任性……？我知道了……\n唔……虽然现在……想不到……但我会努力……试试的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "1b3cb1d46928de47b4d1cfa5a74ad1131f51a5d6a94d5ef12ca1e48b9c7f5a28", "ja": "次の、約束……楽しみに、してるね……？\n{$P$}さん……大好き……♪", "zh": "下次的约定……我很期待哦……？\n{$P$}先生……最喜欢了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0434_1024_p", "source_sha256": "92b1db1a87d66ddb26b67709b6a21f4bbc53984eb6f56133008f0d9f38fe2d00", "ja": "（その後、杏奈の行きたい場所に行って、解散した。\n杏奈も楽しみにしてるし、早く予定を決めないとな！）", "zh": "（之后，我们去了杏奈想去的地方，然后分别回去了。杏奈也很期待，得赶快把计划定下来才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
